{
  "summary": "This experiment tested combining scvi_n200 RNA with ResNet50 image encoder in a singleprofile setup using concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.536 and F1 of 0.516 suggest moderate performance, slightly better than the RNA-only singleprofile baseline (0.520 accuracy). Uncertainty remains about whether the image encoder's choice or fusion method contributes to the result, as no direct comparisons to alternative encoders or fusion strategies were conducted."
}

